<Placemark><name>leave 7:45 Maruya Inn</name><description>Day 4 Course A: O-tsumago → Nagiso → Yogawa-michi → Nenoue Pass → Nojiri. Walk Japan's breakfast is 7:30: ask for it earlier.

Go by 8:08: be here by then to do Course A and catch the 17:26 at Nojiri (else Course B: train from Nagiso).

