<Placemark><name>9:52–10:22 Nagiso Stn · buy picnic lunch</name><description>LAST EXIT: trains from here (Course B ends here). Behind time? Take Course B. Buy the picnic lunch nearby.

Go by 10:15: here by then → carry on to Nojiri for the 17:26.
Back by 17:10: here by then → you can still walk back to Nagiso for the 17:16 (same train, Kiso-Fukushima 18:04; snack, don't stop for lunch).
Later than both → next trains reach Kiso-Fukushima ≈19:05: phone Iwaya Inn about dinner.

